# Loads the flake's devShell (GHC + the site's deps + HLS/cabal/hlint/ormolu)
# so your editor's Haskell Language Server integration "just works".
#
# Requires direnv (https://direnv.net). Run `direnv allow` once in this
# directory, then point your editor's direnv integration at the project.
watch_file ssg/*.cabal
use flake
